        ],
        "Shadow": null,
        "FlavorText": "You have reached the great hall inside Dol Rhugar. There you find Ulchor, Thane of Nurn, waiting for you. \u0060You arrogant fools!\u0060 he says, rising to his full height. \u0060You have pursued me all this way only to die here where my power is at its strongest!\u0060"
